msgstr "ID de usuario no definido."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "Device ID not found in current configuration"
msgstr "ID de dispositivo no encontrado en la configuración actual"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "CAMERA DEVICE SETTINGS"
msgstr "AJUSTES DEL DISPOSITIVO DE CÁMARA"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "DEVICE ID"
msgstr "ID DEL DISPOSITIVO"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "Camera device ID"
msgstr "ID del dispositivo de cámara"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "DEVICE NAME"
msgstr "NOMBRE DEL DISPOSITIVO"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "Camera device name"
msgstr "Nombre del dispositivo de cámara"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "CAMERA DEVICE"
msgstr "DISPOSITIVO DE CÁMARA"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"The v4l2 device to be used for capturing. Example: <code>/dev/video0</code>."
msgstr ""
"El dispositivo v4l2 que se usará para la captura. Ejemplo: <code>/dev/"
"video0</code>."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "V4L2 PARAMETERS"
msgstr "PARÁMETROS V4L2"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"Comma separated list of configuration parameters (aka controls) for the v4l2 "
"device."
msgstr ""
"Lista separada por comas de parámetros de configuración (también llamados "
"controles) para el dispositivo v4l2."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "NETWORK CAMERA URL"
msgstr "URL DE LA CÁMARA DE RED"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"Network camera URL, used for the motion detection. If your camera has a "
"secondary stream with a lower resolution, it is recommended to use the low "
"resolution stream for motion detection and the high resolution stream for "
"recording (see NETWORK CAMERA HIGH RESOLUTION URL)."
msgstr ""
"URL de la cámara de red, usada para la detección de movimiento. Si su cámara "
"tiene un stream secundario con una resolución más baja, se recomienda usar "
"el stream de baja resolución para la detección de movimiento y el stream de "
"alta resolución para la grabación (ver URL DE ALTA RESOLUCIÓN DE LA CÁMARA "
"DE RED)."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "Main camera stream"
msgstr "Stream principal de la cámara"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "Low resolution camera stream"
msgstr "Stream de baja resolución de la cámara"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "Go2RTC stream"
msgstr "Stream de Go2RTC"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "NETWORK CAMERA PARAMS"
msgstr "PARÁMETROS DE LA CÁMARA DE RED"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"Comma separated list of configuration parameters. Format is: "
"option=value,option2=value2."
msgstr ""
"Lista separada por comas de parámetros de configuración. El formato es: "
"opcion=valor,opcion2=valor2."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "NETWORK CAMERA HIGH RESOLUTION URL"
msgstr "URL DE ALTA RESOLUCIÓN DE LA CÁMARA DE RED"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"Network camera high resolution URL. It is recommended to use the high "
"resolution stream of your camera for recording, and the low resolution "
"stream for motion detection (see NETWORK CAMERA URL)."
msgstr ""
"URL de alta resolución de la cámara de red. Se recomienda usar el stream de "
"alta resolución de su cámara para la grabación y el stream de baja "
"resolución para la detección de movimiento (ver URL DE LA CÁMARA DE RED)."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "NETWORK CAMERA HIGH RESOLUTION PARAMS"
msgstr "PARÁMETROS DE ALTA RESOLUCIÓN DE LA CÁMARA DE RED"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "NETWORK CAMERA AUTHENTICATION"
msgstr "AUTENTICACIÓN DE LA CÁMARA DE RED"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"Username and password for the network camera specified as username:password."
msgstr ""
"Nombre de usuario y contraseña de la cámara de red con el formato "
"usuario:contraseña."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "WIDTH"
msgstr "ANCHO"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"The width of the image in pixels. Must be a multiple of 8. For better "
"performance, width and height parameters must match the resolution of the "
"camera."
msgstr ""
"El ancho de la imagen en píxeles. Debe ser múltiplo de 8. Para un mejor "
"rendimiento, los parámetros de ancho y alto deben coincidir con la "
"resolución de la cámara."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "HEIGHT"
msgstr "ALTO"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"The height of the image in pixels. Must be a multiple of 8. For better "
"performance, width and height parameters must match the resolution of the "
"camera."
msgstr ""
"El alto de la imagen en píxeles. Debe ser múltiplo de 8. Para un mejor "
"rendimiento, los parámetros de ancho y alto deben coincidir con la "
"resolución de la cámara."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
#: views/includes/panels/camera/add.inc.php
msgid "FRAME RATE"
msgstr "TASA DE FOTOGRAMAS"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"The number of frames to be processed per second for motion detection. For "
"better performance, the framerate parameter must match the framerate of the "
"camera. If you are using a network camera with two streams (low and high "
"resolution), the framerate parameter must match the framerate of the low "
"resolution stream (in fact the stream used for motion detection)."
msgstr ""
"El número de fotogramas por segundo que se procesan para la detección de "
"movimiento. Para un mejor rendimiento, el parámetro de tasa de fotogramas "
"debe coincidir con la de la cámara. Si usa una cámara de red con dos streams "
"(baja y alta resolución), el parámetro debe coincidir con la tasa de "
"fotogramas del stream de baja resolución (es decir, el stream usado para la "
"detección de movimiento)."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
msgid "ROTATE"
msgstr "ROTACIÓN"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "Rotate image the given number of degrees."
msgstr "Girar la imagen el número de grados indicado."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "DEVICE TIMEOUT"
msgstr "TIEMPO DE ESPERA DEL DISPOSITIVO"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "Number of seconds that elapse before the device is deemed to be lost."
msgstr ""
"Número de segundos que deben transcurrir antes de considerar que el "
"dispositivo se ha perdido."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "WATCHDOG TIMEOUT"
msgstr "TIEMPO DE ESPERA DEL WATCHDOG"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"Number of seconds that elapse before a camera is deemed to be unresponsive "
"and Motion triggers a watchdog timeout and begins to force the camera to "
"shut down."
msgstr ""
"Número de segundos que deben transcurrir antes de considerar que una cámara "
"no responde; Motion activa entonces un timeout del watchdog y empieza a "
"forzar el apagado de la cámara."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "WATCHDOG KILL"
msgstr "WATCHDOG KILL"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"Number of seconds that elapse after the watchdog_tmo that Motion waits until "
"the kill processes begin to force the camera to shut down."
msgstr ""
"Número de segundos después de watchdog_tmo que Motion espera antes de que "
"los procesos kill empiecen a forzar el apagado de la cámara."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "MOTION DETECTION & IMAGE PROCESSING"
msgstr "DETECCIÓN DE MOVIMIENTO Y PROCESAMIENTO DE IMAGEN"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "EMULATE MOTION DETECTION"
msgstr "EMULAR DETECCIÓN DE MOVIMIENTO"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "Always save images even if there was no motion (motion emulation)."
msgstr ""
"Guardar siempre las imágenes aunque no haya movimiento (emulación de "
"movimiento)."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "PAUSE MOTION DETECTION"
msgstr "PAUSAR DETECCIÓN DE MOVIMIENTO"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "Pause detection at start up."
msgstr "Pausar la detección al iniciar."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "MOTION DETECTION SENSITIVITY"
msgstr "SENSIBILIDAD DE DETECCIÓN DE MOVIMIENTO"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "Minimum number of changed pixels that triggers an event."
msgstr "Número mínimo de píxeles modificados que activa un evento."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "THRESHOLD MAXIMUM"
msgstr "UMBRAL MÁXIMO"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"Maximum number of changed pixels that triggers an event. If the number of "
"changed pixels is over the threshold maximum, no event is triggered. A value "
"of zero disables threshold_maximum."
msgstr ""
"Número máximo de píxeles modificados que activa un evento. Si el número de "
"píxeles modificados supera el umbral máximo, no se activa ningún evento. Un "
"valor de cero desactiva threshold_maximum."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "THRESHOLD TUNE"
msgstr "AJUSTE DEL UMBRAL"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "Continuously adjust the threshold for triggering an event."
msgstr "Ajustar continuamente el umbral para activar un evento."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "THRESHOLD SDEVX"
msgstr "UMBRAL SDEVX"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"The maximum standard deviation of the changed pixels in the x (width) axis."
msgstr ""
"La desviación estándar máxima de los píxeles modificados en el eje x (ancho)."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "THRESHOLD SDEVY"
msgstr "UMBRAL SDEVY"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"The maximum standard deviation of the changed pixels in the y (height) axis."
msgstr ""
"La desviación estándar máxima de los píxeles modificados en el eje y (alto)."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "THRESHOLD SDEVXY"
msgstr "UMBRAL SDEVXY"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"The maximum standard deviation of the changed pixels in the x (width) and "
"y(height) axis."
msgstr ""
"La desviación estándar máxima de los píxeles modificados en los ejes x "
"(ancho) e y (alto)."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "THRESHOLD RATIO"
msgstr "RATIO DEL UMBRAL"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"The maximum ratio comparing the pixels that went white to black and vice "
"versa."
msgstr ""
"La proporción máxima entre los píxeles que pasaron de blanco a negro y "
"viceversa."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "THRESHOLD RATIO CHANGE"
msgstr "CAMBIO DE RATIO DEL UMBRAL"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "The minimum change in the ratio to trigger a event."
msgstr "El cambio mínimo de la proporción para activar un evento."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "NOISE LEVEL"
msgstr "NIVEL DE RUIDO"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"The minimum amount of change in a single pixel before it is counted towards "
"the threshold value."
msgstr ""
"La cantidad mínima de cambio en un solo píxel antes de que se tenga en "
"cuenta para el umbral."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "NOISE TUNE"
msgstr "AJUSTE DE RUIDO"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "Continuously adjust the noise_level parameter."
msgstr "Ajustar continuamente el parámetro noise_level."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "DESPECKLE FILTER"
msgstr "FILTRO DESPECKLE"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"Despeckle the image using combinations of (E/e)rode or (D/d)ilate. And "
"ending with optional (l)abeling. This reduces noise in the motion image. "
"Adding a trailing l enables labeling in which only the largest section "
"section is used to calculate the threshold. Typical value is EedDl."
msgstr ""
"Elimina el ruido de la imagen mediante combinaciones de (E/e)rode o (D/"
"d)ilate, terminando opcionalmente con (l)abeling. Esto reduce el ruido en la "
"imagen de movimiento. Añadir una l final activa el etiquetado, con el que "
"solo se usa la sección más grande para calcular el umbral. El valor típico "
"es EedDl."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "MINIMUM MOTION FRAMES"
msgstr "FOTOGRAMAS MÍNIMOS DE MOVIMIENTO"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"The number of frames that must contain motion in order to trigger an event."
msgstr ""
"El número de fotogramas que deben contener movimiento para activar un evento."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "EVENT GAP"
msgstr "INTERVALO ENTRE EVENTOS"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "The seconds of no motion detection that triggers the end of an event."
msgstr ""
"Los segundos sin detección de movimiento que provocan el fin de un evento."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "PRE CAPTURE"
msgstr "PRECAPTURA"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"The number of pre-captured (buffered) frames to be captured before an event."
msgstr ""
"El número de fotogramas precapturados (en búfer) que se capturan antes de un "
"evento."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "POST CAPTURE"
msgstr "POSCAPTURA"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "The number of frames to be captured after an event has ended."
msgstr ""
"El número de fotogramas que se capturan después de que termine un evento."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
msgid "TEXT LEFT"
msgstr "TEXTO IZQUIERDA"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "Text to be written on the left of the image."
msgstr "Texto que se escribe a la izquierda de la imagen."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
msgid "TEXT RIGHT"
msgstr "TEXTO DERECHA"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "Text to be written on the right of the image."
msgstr "Texto que se escribe a la derecha de la imagen."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "TEXT CHANGES"
msgstr "TEXTO DE CAMBIOS"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "Show the number of pixels that changed in the upper right corner."
msgstr ""
"Mostrar el número de píxeles modificados en la esquina superior derecha."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "TEXT SCALE"
msgstr "ESCALA DEL TEXTO"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "Text size."
msgstr "Tamaño del texto."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "AREA DETECT"
msgstr "DETECCIÓN POR ZONAS"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"Detect motion in predefined areas (1 - 9) and when Motion is detected in the "
"area, execute the script. This option is only to execute the on_area_detect "
"script."
msgstr ""
"Detectar movimiento en zonas predefinidas (1 - 9) y, cuando Motion detecta "
"movimiento en la zona, ejecutar el script. Esta opción solo sirve para "
"ejecutar el script on_area_detect."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "MASK FILE"
msgstr "ARCHIVO DE MÁSCARA"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"The full path and filename for the masking pgm file. If needed, the mask "
"will be resized to match the width and height of the image. The areas in the "
"mask file colored black will be excluded from motion detection. Shades of "
"grey on the mask will diminish the detection while areas of white will not "
"have any impact on motion detection."
msgstr ""
"La ruta completa y el nombre del archivo pgm de máscara. Si es necesario, la "
"máscara se redimensiona para ajustarse al ancho y alto de la imagen. Las "
"zonas de color negro del archivo de máscara se excluyen de la detección de "
"movimiento. Los tonos de gris reducen la detección, mientras que las zonas "
"blancas no tienen ningún efecto sobre la detección de movimiento."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "MASK PRIVACY"
msgstr "MÁSCARA DE PRIVACIDAD"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"The full path and filename for the privacy masking pgm file. This mask "
"completely removes the indicated sections of the image."
msgstr ""
"La ruta completa y el nombre del archivo pgm de máscara de privacidad. Esta "
"máscara elimina por completo las secciones indicadas de la imagen."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "SMART MASK SPEED"
msgstr "VELOCIDAD DE LA MÁSCARA INTELIGENTE"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"The smartmask is intended to be a dynamic, self-learning mask to decrease "
"sensitivity in areas with frequent motion. The speed specified by this "
"parameter is how quickly the mask gets adjusted. Zero disables the smart "
"mask."
msgstr ""
"La máscara inteligente es una máscara dinámica que aprende por sí misma para "
"reducir la sensibilidad en zonas con movimiento frecuente. La velocidad "
"indicada por este parámetro define la rapidez con la que se ajusta la "
"máscara. Cero desactiva la máscara inteligente."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "LOCATE MOTION MODE"
msgstr "MODO DE LOCALIZACIÓN DEL MOVIMIENTO"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"Locate and draw around/on the moving object. Preview only applies to "
"pictures."
msgstr ""
"Localizar el objeto en movimiento y dibujar alrededor/sobre él. Preview solo "
"se aplica a las imágenes."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "LOCATE MOTION STYLE"
msgstr "ESTILO DE LOCALIZACIÓN DEL MOVIMIENTO"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "Set the look and style of the locate mode."
msgstr "Definir el aspecto y el estilo del modo de localización."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "LIGHTSWITCH PERCENT"
msgstr "PORCENTAJE DE CAMBIO DE LUZ"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"The minimum change in the portion of the image that will trigger a "
"lightswitch condition."
msgstr ""
"El cambio mínimo en la proporción de la imagen que activa una condición de "
"cambio de luz."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "LIGHTSWITCH FRAMES"
msgstr "FOTOGRAMAS DE CAMBIO DE LUZ"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"The number of frames to ignore when the lightswitch condition is triggered "
"(see above)."
msgstr ""
"El número de fotogramas que se ignoran cuando se activa la condición de "
"cambio de luz (ver arriba)."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "STATIC OBJECT TIME"
msgstr "TIEMPO DE OBJETO ESTÁTICO"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"Number of seconds before a new object is included in the reference image."
msgstr ""
"Número de segundos antes de que un nuevo objeto se incluya en la imagen de "
"referencia."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "MOVIES GENERAL SETTINGS"
msgstr "AJUSTES GENERALES DE VÍDEOS"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "MOVIE OUTPUT"
msgstr "SALIDA DE VÍDEO"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "Encode movies of the motion events."
msgstr "Codificar vídeos de los eventos de movimiento."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "MOVIE OUTPUT MOTION"
msgstr "SALIDA DE VÍDEO DE MOVIMIENTO"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"Encode movies that show the pixels that changed. If labeling is enabled via "
"the despeckle option, the largest area will be in blue. If smartmask is "
"enabled it will be shown in red."
msgstr ""
"Codificar vídeos que muestran los píxeles modificados. Si el etiquetado está "
"activado mediante la opción despeckle, la zona más grande aparece en azul. "
"Si la máscara inteligente está activada, se muestra en rojo."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "MOVIE MAX TIME"
msgstr "DURACIÓN MÁXIMA DEL VÍDEO"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"The maximum length of a movie in seconds. Set this to zero for unlimited "
"length."
msgstr ""
"La duración máxima de un vídeo en segundos. Póngalo a cero para una duración "
"ilimitada."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "MOVIE BPS"
msgstr "BPS DEL VÍDEO"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"Bitrate to use in encoding of movies. This option is ignored if "
"movie_quality is specified."
msgstr ""
"Tasa de bits que se usa para codificar los vídeos. Esta opción se ignora si "
"se especifica movie_quality."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "MOVIE QUALITY"
msgstr "CALIDAD DEL VÍDEO"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"A value of 0 disables this option while values 1 - 100 change the quality of "
"the movie. The value of 1 means worst quality and 100 is the best quality. "
"High values of this option (e.g. 100) may cause difficulty with some players."
msgstr ""
"Un valor de 0 desactiva esta opción, mientras que los valores de 1 a 100 "
"cambian la calidad del vídeo. El valor 1 es la peor calidad y 100 la mejor. "
"Los valores altos de esta opción (p. ej. 100) pueden causar problemas con "
"algunos reproductores."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "MOVIE CONTAINER"
msgstr "CONTENEDOR DEL VÍDEO"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"Container/Codec to be used for the video. Preferred codec can be appended "
"e.g. <code>mkv:libx265</code>"
msgstr ""
"Contenedor/códec que se usará para el vídeo. Se puede añadir el códec "
"preferido, p. ej. <code>mkv:libx265</code>"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "MOVIE RETAIN"
msgstr "CONSERVAR VÍDEO"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "Retain movie only if the secondary detection occurred."
msgstr "Conservar el vídeo solo si se produjo la detección secundaria."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "MOVIE PASSTHROUGH"
msgstr "PASSTHROUGH DE VÍDEO"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"When using a RTSP, RTMP, mjpeg and some V4l2 cameras, create movie files "
"with the packets obtained directly from the camera."
msgstr ""
"Con cámaras RTSP, RTMP, MJPEG y algunas V4L2, crear los archivos de vídeo "
"con los paquetes obtenidos directamente de la cámara."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "MOVIE FILENAME"
msgstr "NOMBRE DEL ARCHIVO DE VÍDEO"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"The file name and optionally the path for the movie relative to target_dir. "
"The file extension is automatically added based upon the container."
msgstr ""
"El nombre de archivo y, opcionalmente, la ruta del vídeo relativa a "
"target_dir. La extensión se añade automáticamente según el contenedor."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "MOVIE EXTPIPE USE"
msgstr "USAR EXTPIPE DE VÍDEO"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"Specifies whether to send the pictures to pipe for external encoding into a "
"movie."
msgstr ""
"Indica si se envían las imágenes a una tubería para su codificación externa "
"en un vídeo."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "MOVIE EXTPIPE"
msgstr "EXTPIPE DE VÍDEO"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "The program name and options for processing the images."
msgstr "El nombre del programa y las opciones para procesar las imágenes."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "VIDEO PIPE"
msgstr "TUBERÍA DE VÍDEO"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"The video4linux video loopback device for normal images. The device would be "
"specified in the format like /dev/video1"
msgstr ""
"El dispositivo loopback de video4linux para las imágenes normales. El "
"dispositivo se especifica con el formato /dev/video1"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "VIDEO PIPE MOTION"
msgstr "TUBERÍA DE VÍDEO DE MOVIMIENTO"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"The video4linux video loopback device for motion images. The device would be "
"specified in the format like /dev/video1"
msgstr ""
"El dispositivo loopback de video4linux para las imágenes de movimiento. El "
"dispositivo se especifica con el formato /dev/video1"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "PICTURES GENERAL SETTINGS"
msgstr "AJUSTES GENERALES DE IMÁGENES"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "PICTURE OUTPUT"
msgstr "SALIDA DE IMAGEN"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"'on' saves all motion images during an event. 'first' saves only the first "
"image that detected motion. 'best' saves image with most changed pixels."
msgstr ""
"'on' guarda todas las imágenes de movimiento durante un evento. 'first' "
"guarda solo la primera imagen que detectó movimiento. 'best' guarda la "
"imagen con más píxeles modificados."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "PICTURE OUTPUT MOTION"
msgstr "SALIDA DE IMAGEN DE MOVIMIENTO"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"Save the motion(debug) pictures with the pixels that change as a graytone "
"image. If labeling is enabled via the despeckele option, the largest area "
"will be blue and areas in red are those determined by the smartmask option."
msgstr ""
"Guardar las imágenes de movimiento (depuración) con los píxeles modificados "
"como imagen en escala de grises. Si el etiquetado está activado mediante la "
"opción despeckle, la zona más grande aparece en azul y las zonas en rojo son "
"las determinadas por la opción smartmask."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "PICTURE TYPE"
msgstr "TIPO DE IMAGEN"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "The type of picture file to output."
msgstr "El tipo de archivo de imagen de salida."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "PICTURE QUALITY"
msgstr "CALIDAD DE IMAGEN"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"The image quality for the jpeg or webp images in percent. The value of 1 is "
"worst and 100 is best."
msgstr ""
"La calidad de las imágenes jpeg o webp en porcentaje. El valor 1 es el peor "
"y 100 el mejor."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "PICTURE EXIF"
msgstr "EXIF DE IMAGEN"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "The text for the JPEG EXIF comment with the EXIF timestamp."
msgstr "El texto del comentario EXIF de JPEG con la marca de tiempo EXIF."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "PICTURE FILENAME"
msgstr "NOMBRE DEL ARCHIVO DE IMAGEN"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"The filename for the picture files. The default filename is %v-%Y%m%d%H%M%S-"
"%q."
msgstr ""
"El nombre de los archivos de imagen. El nombre por defecto es %v-"
"%Y%m%d%H%M%S-%q."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "SCRIPT EXECUTION"
msgstr "EJECUCIÓN DE SCRIPTS"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "ON EVENT START"
msgstr "AL INICIAR UN EVENTO"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"The full path and file name of the program/script to be executed at the "
"start of an event."
msgstr ""
"La ruta completa y el nombre del programa/script que se ejecuta al inicio de "
"un evento."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "ON EVENT END"
msgstr "AL FINALIZAR UN EVENTO"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"The full path and file name of the program/script to be executed at the end "
"of an event."
msgstr ""
"La ruta completa y el nombre del programa/script que se ejecuta al final de "
"un evento."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "ON PICTURE SAVE"
msgstr "AL GUARDAR UNA IMAGEN"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"The full path and file name of the program/script to be executed when a "
"picture is saved."
msgstr ""
"La ruta completa y el nombre del programa/script que se ejecuta cuando se "
"guarda una imagen."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "ON MOTION DETECTED"
msgstr "AL DETECTAR MOVIMIENTO"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"The full path and file name of the program/script to be executed when motion "
"is detected."
msgstr ""
"La ruta completa y el nombre del programa/script que se ejecuta cuando se "
"detecta movimiento."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "ON AREA DETECTED"
msgstr "AL DETECTAR MOVIMIENTO EN ZONA"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"The full path and file name of the program/script to be executed when motion "
"is detected in the area specified."
msgstr ""
"La ruta completa y el nombre del programa/script que se ejecuta cuando se "
"detecta movimiento en la zona especificada."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "ON MOVIE START"
msgstr "AL INICIAR UN VÍDEO"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"The full path and file name of the program/script to be executed at the "
"creation of a movie."
msgstr ""
"La ruta completa y el nombre del programa/script que se ejecuta al crear un "
"vídeo."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "ON MOVIE END"
msgstr "AL FINALIZAR UN VÍDEO"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"The full path and file name of the program/script to be executed when a "
"movie ends."
msgstr ""
"La ruta completa y el nombre del programa/script que se ejecuta cuando "
"termina un vídeo."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "ON CAMERA LOST"
msgstr "AL PERDER LA CÁMARA"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"The full path and file name of the program/script to be executed when the "
"camera is no longer detected."
msgstr ""
"La ruta completa y el nombre del programa/script que se ejecuta cuando la "
"cámara deja de detectarse."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "ON CAMERA FOUND"
msgstr "AL RECUPERAR LA CÁMARA"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"The full path and file name of the program/script to be executed when a "
"previously lost camera is active again."
msgstr ""
"La ruta completa y el nombre del programa/script que se ejecuta cuando una "
"cámara perdida vuelve a estar activa."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "ON SECONDARY DETECT"
msgstr "AL PRODUCIRSE UNA DETECCIÓN SECUNDARIA"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"The full path and file name of the program/script to be executed when "
"secondary detection occurs."
msgstr ""
"La ruta completa y el nombre del programa/script que se ejecuta cuando se "
"produce una detección secundaria."

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid "ON SOUND ALERT"
msgstr "AL PRODUCIRSE UNA ALERTA DE SONIDO"

#: controllers/Layout/Panel/vars/motion/edit.vars.inc.php
msgid ""
"The full path and file name of the program/script to be executed when a "
"sound alert is triggered."
msgstr ""
"La ruta completa y el nombre del programa/script que se ejecuta cuando se "
"activa una alerta de sonido."

