#: views/includes/panels/motion/autostart.inc.php
msgid ""
"Motion detection will be started if none of the configured devices are "
"present on the local network."
msgstr ""
"La detección de movimiento se iniciará si ninguno de los dispositivos "
"configurados está presente en la red local."

#: views/includes/panels/motion/autostart.inc.php
msgid ""
"Motion detection will be stopped if at least <b>one</b> of the configured "
"devices is connected to the local network."
msgstr ""
"La detección de movimiento se detendrá si al menos <b>uno</b> de los "
"dispositivos configurados está conectado a la red local."

#: views/includes/panels/motion/autostart.inc.php
msgid "KNOWN DEVICES"
msgstr "DISPOSITIVOS CONOCIDOS"

