#: views/includes/panels/motion/autostart.inc.php
msgid "It can be a smartphone, a tablet, etc ..."
msgstr "Puede ser un smartphone, una tableta, etc ..."

#: views/includes/panels/motion/autostart.inc.php
msgid "A name to identify the device."
msgstr "Un nombre para identificar el dispositivo."

#: views/includes/panels/motion/autostart.inc.php
msgid "e.g. Alice smartphone"
msgstr "p. ej. Smartphone de Alice"

#: views/includes/panels/motion/autostart.inc.php
msgid "IP ADDRESS"
msgstr "DIRECCIÓN IP"

#: views/includes/panels/motion/autostart.inc.php
msgid "The IP address of the device on the local network."
msgstr "La dirección IP del dispositivo en la red local."

#: views/includes/panels/motion/autostart.inc.php
msgid "e.g. 192.168.0.10"
msgstr "p. ej. 192.168.0.10"

#: views/includes/panels/motion/autostart.inc.php
msgid "AUTOSTART TIME PERIOD"
msgstr "PERIODO DE INICIO AUTOMÁTICO"

#: views/includes/panels/motion/autostart.inc.php
msgid ""
"Autostart on device presence is enabled. Time period will be prioritized if "
"current time is in the time period."
msgstr ""
"El inicio automático según la presencia de dispositivos está activado. El "
"periodo tendrá prioridad si la hora actual está dentro del periodo."

#: views/includes/panels/motion/autostart.inc.php
msgid ""
"For each day, define the time period in which <b>motion</b> will be running. "
"Outside of this time period, device presence will take over."
msgstr ""
"Defina para cada día el periodo durante el cual <b>motion</b> estará en "
"marcha. Fuera de este periodo, la presencia de dispositivos toma el relevo."

#: views/includes/panels/motion/autostart.inc.php
msgid ""
"For each day, define the time period in which <b>motion</b> will be running. "
"Outside of this time period, <b>motion</b> will be stopped."
msgstr ""
"Defina para cada día el periodo durante el cual <b>motion</b> estará en "
"marcha. Fuera de este periodo, <b>motion</b> se detendrá."

#: views/includes/panels/motion/autostart.inc.php
msgid ""
"Specify <b>Start:</b> <code>--:--</code> and <b>End:</b> <code>--:--</code> "
"if you wish not to run motion on a specific day."
msgstr ""
"Indique <b>Inicio:</b> <code>--:--</code> y <b>Fin:</b> <code>--:--</code> "
"si no desea ejecutar motion un día concreto."

#: views/includes/panels/motion/autostart.inc.php
msgid ""
"Specify <b>Start:</b> <code>00:00</code> and <b>End:</b> <code>00:00</code> "
"if you wish to run motion <b>24hours a day</b>."
msgstr ""
"Indique <b>Inicio:</b> <code>00:00</code> y <b>Fin:</b> <code>00:00</code> "
"si desea ejecutar motion <b>las 24 horas del día</b>."

